<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>No Recoil All Weapons - Jitter</Major>
    <Description>My settings:

1920x1080 + 800 dpi + 1.3 / 1.0 ADS

This macro will make your screen shake when you shoot, this is normal, your aim will be stuck in the middle of the screen. If a bug appears, increase the timings. Over all helps!</Description>
